- claim 6129978918;
- report 6132131059.

Everything below was checked on GitHub, not taken from the report. Classes, positions and functions only.

- **Form:**
  - draft to `main`, assignee `os-steve`;
  - line 1 `Fixes #23074`, the only closing keyword;
  - line 2 `Clause-②: no`.
- **Scope:**
  - 7 files, +305 / −30, none governed (`check-governed-merges`: clean);
  - no `packages/spec` source, so no contract surface, and the seat read the diff itself;
  - nothing under `content/docs/releases/`.
- **Fix, read in the diff:**
  - `mergeArtifactProtection` now takes the type, and grafts an artifact only onto a body of the same bundle member (a new module-private `bundleMemberOf`, which reads `itemDiscriminator`);
  - its four call sites pass the type;
  - the three that can serve a member look up the artifact at the body's own member, so a shipped non-canonical member keeps its envelope;
  - `removeRuntimeShadow` returns to member level for a named member.
- **Evidence:**
  - reproduced on `main`: an unshipped `zh-CN` overlay was registered with the package's envelope, `isCodeArtifactBody` was true, and it was served under provenance `package`;
  - the new block has 10 cases, each with its own CONTROL;
  - four ablation legs each reddened only their own cases. A3, the unconditional graft back, also reddened #22877's no-artifact door case, which shows `removeRuntimeShadow`'s member level is sound only together with the graft fix;
  - the showcase dogfood passes 4/4 on the fixed dist;
  - 69 derived gate commands, all exit 0.
- **CI on `5d156f7044`:** 40 check runs, none failed.
- **Acceptance notes:**
  - for an unshipped member, `resettable: true` and the DELETE receipt "reset to artifact default" come from a name-level `isArtifactBacked`. A by-name read of that member answers 404 after the reset, while at send time it does fall back to the package's `en-US` wording. #22877 pinned `reset: true` for this case deliberately, so this is left as is;
  - the lock is unchanged (it resolves at name level).

**Landing:** prechecks pass:
- every check is green;
- merge-tree is clean against `origin/main`;
- not governed;
- 335 lines.

The PR is readied and armed through the relay in this act.
